# DevForge Database Structure

## 📁 Directory Structure

\`\`\`
database/
├── firestore/
│   ├── schema.js           # Database schema definitions
│   ├── connection.js       # Database connection helpers
│   ├── indexes/            # Firestore indexes
│   └── rules/              # Security rules
├── firebase/
│   └── firebase.js         # Client-side Firebase config
├── migrations/             # Database migrations
├── backups/               # Backup scripts
├── scripts/               # Utility scripts
└── seeders/               # Seed data
\`\`\`

## 🚀 Quick Start

### Install dependencies
\`\`\`bash
npm install
\`\`\`

### Set up environment variables
Copy \`.env.example\` to \`.env\` and fill in your Firebase credentials.

### Seed the database
\`\`\`bash
npm run seed
\`\`\`

### Run migrations
\`\`\`bash
npm run migrate
\`\`\`

### Backup database
\`\`\`bash
npm run backup
\`\`\`

## 📊 Collections Overview

- **users** - User profiles and authentication
- **posts** - Project posts from interns
- **comments** - Comments on posts
- **likes** - Like records
- **saves** - Saved posts
- **notifications** - User notifications
- **adminLogs** - Admin action logs
- **aiUsage** - AI assistant usage tracking
- **flaggedContent** - Reported content

## 🔒 Security Rules

Firestore security rules are in \`firestore/rules/firestore.rules\`
Deploy with: \`firebase deploy --only firestore:rules\`

## 📈 Indexes

Index configuration in \`firestore/indexes/firestore.indexes.json\`
Deploy with: \`firebase deploy --only firestore:indexes\`
